# Log in, log out from the panel menu, then Shut down on the login screen (the path of the laptop report).
@desktop
@ok the panel runs as tester :: pgrep -u tester -x flpanel
@key meta_l
@wait 2
@mouse 304 731
@click
@wait 2
@shot @OUT@/gs-1-logout-dialog.ppm
# Enter is the dialog's main button (Shut down now / Log out now); its place on the screen moves with the windows behind it
@key ret
@waitok 60 the login screen came back after the logout :: pgrep -x flgreet-ui && ! pgrep -u tester -x flpanel
@wait 4
@shot @OUT@/gs-2-greeter.ppm
@mouse 534 535
@click
@wait 1
@shot @OUT@/gs-3-armed.ppm
@click
@poweroffwait 30
